# CounterAPI v2 (https://docs.counterapi.dev) — read server-side only, by netlify/functions/counter.js.
# Create a workspace and a Read+Write scoped token (no Admin) at https://counterapi.dev
#
# Local dev: copy this to .env, fill in the values, then run `netlify dev` (it loads .env automatically).
# Production: these are never read from a committed file. Push them to Netlify's own env var store with
#   netlify env:import .env
# or set them in the Netlify dashboard under Site configuration → Environment variables.
COUNTER_API_WORKSPACE=
COUNTER_API_TOKEN=
